art":{"line":46,"column":57,"offset":1633},"end":{"line":46,"column":78,"offset":1654}}},{"type":"text","value":"。","position":{"start":{"line":46,"column":78,"offset":1654},"end":{"line":46,"column":79,"offset":1655}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":46,"column":1,"offset":1577},"end":{"line":46,"column":79,"offset":1655}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Pinocchio 程式","position":{"start":{"line":48,"column":3,"offset":1661},"end":{"line":48,"column":15,"offset":1673}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":48,"column":1,"offset":1659},"end":{"line":48,"column":17,"offset":1675}}},{"type":"text","value":"：通過 Solana CLI 部署，並將您的配置設置為 localnet：","position":{"start":{"line":48,"column":17,"offset":1675},"end":{"line":48,"column":54,"offset":1712}}},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"solana program deploy ./target/deploy/your_program.so --program-id ./target/deploy/your_program-keypair.json","position":{"start":{"line":48,"column":54,"offset":1712},"end":{"line":48,"column":164,"offset":1822}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":48,"column":1,"offset":1659},"end":{"line":48,"column":164,"offset":1822}}},{"type":"blockquote","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"在 Anchor Workspace 中運行 ","position":{"start":{"line":50,"column":3,"offset":1828},"end":{"line":50,"column":26,"offset":1851}}},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"surfpool start","position":{"start":{"line":50,"column":26,"offset":1851},"end":{"line":50,"column":42,"offset":1867}}},{"type":"text","value":"，可提示您使用基礎設施即代碼（Infrastructure as Code），以便在 Surfnet 上無縫自動部署您的程式。","position":{"start":{"line":50,"column":42,"offset":1867},"end":{"line":50,"column":105,"offset":1930}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":50,"column":3,"offset":1828},"end":{"line":50,"column":105,"offset":1930}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":50,"column":1,"offset":1826},"end":{"line":50,"column":105,"offset":1930}}},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"children":[{"type":"text","value":"測試程式","position":{"start":{"line":52,"column":5,"offset":1938},"end":{"line":52,"column":9,"offset":1942}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":52,"column":1,"offset":1934},"end":{"line":52,"column":9,"offset":1942}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"部署到 localnet 後，通過定位本地驗證器連接到 Surfnet：","position":{"start":{"line":54,"column":1,"offset":1946},"end":{"line":54,"column":37,"offset":1982}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":54,"column":1,"offset":1946},"end":{"line":54,"column":37,"offset":1982}}},{"type":"code","lang":"ts","meta":null,"value":"import { Connection } from \"@solana/web3.js\";\r\n\r\nconst connection = new Connection(\"http://localhost:8899\", \"confirmed\");","position":{"start":{"line":56,"column":1,"offset":1986},"end":{"line":60,"column":4,"offset":2119}},"data":{"highlightId":"code-0"}}],"position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1,"offset":0},"end":{"line":60,"column":4,"offset":2119}}},"raw":"import { ArticleSection } from \"../../../../components/ArticleSection/ArticleSection\";\r\n\r\n# Surfpool 101\r\n\r\n![使用 Surfpool 測試](/graphics/course-banners/testing-with-surfpool.png)\r\n\r\n測試依賴跨程序調用（CPI）的 Solana 程序，傳統上需要開發者從主網導出賬戶和程序，然後將它們上傳到本地驗證器。\r\n\r\n這個過程對於少量賬戶來說是可行的，但在測試像 Jupiter 這樣的複雜程序的 CPI 時，這些程序可能依賴於超過 40 個賬戶和 8 個以上的程序，這就完全不可行了。\r\n\r\nSurfpool 通過以下功能解決了這個問題，讓開發者能夠使用按需獲取的主網賬戶在本地模擬程序：\r\n- **自定義系統變量**：時間旅行（在任何歷史槽位或時間戳測試您的程序）、暫停時鐘或停止區塊生成\r\n- **修改賬戶數據**：設置 SOL 供應量（總量、流通量和非流通量）、在程序之間轉移賬戶數據，或更新賬戶核心數據和代幣賬戶信息\r\n- **分析鏈上數據**：分析交易的計算單元、賬戶變更和執行細節，然後通過簽名、UUID 或標籤檢索詳細的分析報告\r\n\r\n<ArticleSection name=\"什麼是 Surfpool\" id=\"what-is-surfpool\" level=\"h2\" />\r\n\r\n[Surfpool](https://docs.surfpool.run/) 是一個全面的 SDK 和工具套件，而 **Surfnet** 是它創建的本地 Solana 網絡。可以將 Surfpool 視為您的開發環境，而 Surfnet 則是運行在其中的區塊鏈網絡。\r\n\r\nSurfnet 是 solana-test-validator 的即插即用替代品，專為提供最佳 Solana 開發者體驗而設計。\r\n\r\n由 [TxTx](https://x.com/txtx_sol) 團隊開發的 Surfpool，無縫地將基礎設施即代碼集成到基於 Anchor 的項目中，實現可重現、可審計且安全的部署，適用於任何 Solana 網絡——無論是私有還是公共。\r\n\r\n<ArticleSection name=\"第一步\" id=\"first-steps\" level=\"h2\" />\r\n\r\n運行 Surfnet 所需的一切都包含在 Surfpool SDK 中。由於安裝因操作系統而異，請參考官方的[安裝頁面](https://docs.surfpool.run/install)來完成您的特定設置。\r\n\r\n安裝 Surfpool SDK 後，使用以下指令啟動 Surfnet：\r\n\r\n```bash\r\nsurfpool start\r\n```\r\n\r\n這會在標準本地驗證器埠（`http://127.0.0.1:8899`）上啟動 Surfnet，並顯示終端用戶介面，內容包括：\r\n- **時段與時代（Slots and Epoch）**：目前執行的時段每 400 毫秒自動處理一次。使用 **Tab** 手動前進到下一個時段，或使用 **空格鍵** 暫停/恢復自動區塊生成。\r\n- **交易日誌**：帶有時間戳的活動流，顯示所有執行的交易內容。\r\n\r\n如需基於瀏覽器的體驗，請連接到 Surfpool Studio：[此連結](http://127.0.0.1:8899)。\r\n\r\n> Surfpool Studio 包含所有終端用戶介面功能，並提供額外功能，例如時間旅行和向任何鑄幣帳戶添加代幣。\r\n\r\n### 部署程式\r\n\r\n設置好 Surfnet 後，部署您的程式並開始構建。\r\n\r\n**Anchor 程式**：使用 `anchor deploy`，並將您的 `Anchor.toml` 配置為 `[programs.localnet]`。\r\n\r\n**Pinocchio 程式**：通過 Solana CLI 部署，並將您的配置設置為 localnet：`solana program deploy ./target/deploy/your_program.so --program-id ./target/deploy/your_program-keypair.json`\r\n\r\n> 在 Anchor Workspace 中運行 `surfpool start`，可提示您使用基礎設施即代碼（Infrastructure as Code），以便在 Surfnet 上無縫自動部署您的程式。\r\n\r\n### 測試程式\r\n\r\n部署到 localnet 後，通過定位本地驗證器連接到 Surfnet：\r\n\r\n```ts\r\nimport { Connection } from \"@solana/web3.js\";\r\n\r\nconst connection = new Connection(\"http://localhost:8899\", \"confirmed\");\r\n```","highlightedCode":{"code-0":{"lang":"ts","hast":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"pre","properties":{"class":"shiki Kiloshift","style":"background-color:#11141a;color:#f6f6f4","tabindex":"0"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"code","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"class":"line"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F286C4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"import"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F6F6F4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":" { Connection } "}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F286C4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"from"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#DEE492"},"children":[{"t